#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:14
msgid "Old Film"
msgstr "Filme vello"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:17
msgid ""
"This is the `OldFilm <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterOldfilm/>`_ "
"MLT filter."
msgstr ""
"Este é o filtro de `filme vello <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/"
"FilterOldfilm/>`_ de MLT."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/oldfilm.rst:19
msgid ""
"Moves the video up and down and adds random brightness changes, making it "
"look like old film footage."
msgstr ""
"Move o vídeo arriba e abaixo e engade cambios de brillo aleatorios, para que "
"parece unha gravación vella de filme."

